@startuml
left to right direction
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram

actor Editor
actor Player
actor ProductOwner

Editor --> (UC1 - Create a Map)
Editor --> (UC2 - Add an Industry)
Editor --> (UC3 - Add a City)
Editor --> (UC4 - Create a Scenario)

(UC1 - Create a Map) --> (Define Map Size)
(UC1 - Create a Map) --> (Set Map Name)
(UC2 - Add an Industry) --> (Specify Position XY)
(UC3 - Add a City) --> (Indicate Coordinates XY)
(UC3 - Add a City) --> (Set City Name)
(UC3 - Add a City) --> (Define House Blocks)
(Set City Name) --> (No Special Characters/Digits)
(Define House Blocks) --> (Must be Positive)
(Define House Blocks) --> (Manually or Automatically)

Player --> (UC5 - Build a Station)
Player --> (UC6 - Upgrade a Station)
Player --> (UC7 - List all the Stations)
Player --> (UC8 - Build a Railway Line)
Player --> (UC9 - Buy a Train)
Player --> (UC10 - Assign a Train to a Route)
Player --> (UC11 - List all Trains)

(UC5 - Build a Station) --> (Check Overbuilding)
(UC8 - Build a Railway Line) --> (Select stations from Registered Stations)
(UC9 - Buy a Train) --> (Select Locomotive from List)
(UC10 - Assign a Train to a Route) --> (Choose Valid Stations)
(UC11 - List all Trains) --> (Group by Locomotive Type)
(UC11 - List all Trains) --> (Sort Alphabetically)

ProductOwner --> (UC12 - Create a Cargo Generator Simulator)
(UC12 - Create a Cargo Generator Simulator) --> (Generate Cargo at Stations)
(UC12 - Create a Cargo Generator Simulator) --> (Consider Cities and Industries)
(UC12 - Create a Cargo Generator Simulator) --> (Provide Start/Pause Option)

@enduml

